# Regenerable run state: rebuilt on first run, rewritten by every run.
# Tracking these buried real diffs under thousands of churned lines.
# Safe to omit -- load_seen() checks .exists(), load_cursor() catches, and
# every save does mkdir(parents=True), so a fresh clone recreates them. The
# portal dedupes on event_id, so it re-discovers rather than duplicating.
# tickers.json is deliberately NOT here: that is configuration.
data/seen_events.json
data/seen_newswire_ca.json
data/pipeline_cursor.json
